==New Bark Town==
===Home===
After the credits end, you find yourself back home in [[New Bark Town]]. When you walk downstairs, {{jo|Mom}} informs you that [[Professor Elm]] has something to give you.

===Professor Elm's Lab===
Speak to [[Professor Elm]] to receive an [[S.S. Ticket]], a boarding pass for the [[S.S. Aqua]] in [[Olivine City]].

==Olivine City==
===Olivine Harbor===
Enter the building on the south side of town to reach the port. Inside, you run into [[Professor Oak]]. He believes that it is time for your [[Pokédex]] to match your new role as Champion, and upgrades the device with its [[National Pokédex|National Mode]]. He warns that it will not be as easy to complete the National Pokédex, then suddenly realizes that he is late for a recording of his radio show. He invites you to visit his lab in [[Pallet Town]], then hurries off to [[Goldenrod City]].

Speak to the Sailor to present the [[S.S. Ticket]]. Enter the harbor and speak to a second Sailor to board the ship for [[Kanto]]'s [[Vermilion City]].

==S.S. Aqua==
